{"name":"Honey Grove","hex":"#dcb149","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"honey","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A sweet, viscous, gold-colored fluid produced from plant nectar by bees, and often consumed by humans.","A variety of this substance."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Involving or resembling honey.","Of a pale yellow to brownish-yellow color, like most types of honey."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/honey"},{"term":"grove","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A small forest.","A small forest with minimal undergrowth."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To cultivate in groves; to grow naturally so as to form groves.","To cultivate with periodic harvesting that also serves to create order (gaps and lines of trees) to facilitate further harvesting."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/grove"}],"entries":[{"title":"Honey Grove, Texas","blocks":[{"text":"Honey Grove is a city in Fannin County, Texas, United States. Honey Grove bills itself as \"The Sweetest Town in Texas\". The population was 1,715 at the 2020 census, up from 1,668 at the 2010 census."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8f/Downtown_Honey_Grove6_%281_of_1%29.jpg/330px-Downtown_Honey_Grove6_%281_of_1%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Honey_Grove%2C_Texas","wikidata":"Q981126"},{"title":"Honey","blocks":[{"text":"Honey is a sweet and viscous substance made by several species of bees, the best-known of which are honey bees. Honey is made and stored to nourish bee colonies. Bees produce honey by gathering and then refining the sugary secretions of plants or the secretions of other insects, like the honeydew of aphids. This refinement takes place both within individual bees, through regurgitation and enzymatic activity, and during storage in the hive, through water evaporation that concentrates the honey's sugars until it is thick and viscous."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cc/Runny_hunny.jpg/330px-Runny_hunny.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Honey","wikidata":"Q10987"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/85/Honey_Grove_Post_Office_%281_of_1%29.jpg/250px-Honey_Grove_Post_Office_%281_of_1%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/85/Honey_Grove_Post_Office_%281_of_1%29.jpg/500px-Honey_Grove_Post_Office_%281_of_1%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/85/Honey_Grove_Post_Office_%281_of_1%29.jpg/250px-Honey_Grove_Post_Office_%281_of_1%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHoney_Grove_Post_Office_(1_of_1).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/Downtown_Honey_Grove7_%281_of_1%29.jpg/250px-Downtown_Honey_Grove7_%281_of_1%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/Downtown_Honey_Grove7_%281_of_1%29.jpg/500px-Downtown_Honey_Grove7_%281_of_1%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/Downtown_Honey_Grove7_%281_of_1%29.jpg/250px-Downtown_Honey_Grove7_%281_of_1%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADowntown_Honey_Grove7_(1_of_1).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7c/Downtown_Honey_Grove4_%281_of_1%29.jpg/250px-Downtown_Honey_Grove4_%281_of_1%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&